.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2234/xs_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Superhuman_1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2234/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Superhuman_1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2234/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Superhuman_1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2234/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Superhuman_1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2234/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Superhuman_1.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2234/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Superhuman_1.jpg","Email is fundamental to how we communicate. But if you ask people about their inboxes, they’ll probably tell you email is a necessary evil, a flawed experience and a source of anxiety. While productivity software has improved in leaps and bounds since its introduction, email clients have barely changed—until Superhuman.\r\n\r\nSuperhuman is an email client that aims to help you become happier, more productive and closer to reaching your potential. A lofty goal perhaps, but one that Superhuman is having no trouble delivering on, according to rave reviews from customers. The platform prioritizes speed, AI integration and a delightful UX to help you get through your inbox twice as fast as before, reply to important emails sooner and even achieve the fabled “Inbox Zero” for the first time in years. Superhuman is a special SaaS company with a bold vision for the future of work, fundamentally re-thinking how individuals and teams collaborate.","Superhuman is an email client that helps users become happier and more productive by prioritizing speed, AI integration and a delightful UX.","Superhuman - IVP Portfolio - Email Software Venture Capital","Superhuman - IVP Portfolio  ","The fastest email experience ever made",{"id":32,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg